            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "調查顯示蘋果iPhone換機潮表現優於預期",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"調查顯示蘋果iPhone換機潮表現優於預期\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cc0fc3635d7b271c4e280833a3698f3c184bfdc4298f847d8fe5eae1d3759106/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA6U04V_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">調查顯示蘋果iPhone換機潮表現優於預期</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 投資銀行<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/Evercore\" rel=\"\">Evercore</a> ISI在最新報告中向投資者指出，其最新消費者調查結果顯示，蘋果公司的iPhone升級換機週期表現強於預期，且定價策略有望帶來可觀的順風助力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該機構對近4,000名消費者進行的年度調查顯示，在最新機型的帶動下，iPhone換機週期「表現優於預期」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">除了銷量表現強勁外，Evercore指出，受較高定價、高端機型需求增加以及消費者傾向選購更大儲存容量配置等因素驅動，iPhone整體定價有望上漲逾20%。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-0167dcb4-e53b-308e-8714-2dff0f5e69b2-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">報告指出「Pro Max依然稱王」，53%的受訪者計劃購買iPhone 18 Pro或Pro Max，其中32%明確表示有意購買Pro Max，較去年的29%有所提升。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">至於新款摺疊屏iPhone Duo，目前需求相對較為溫和，僅有14%的受訪者表示有意購買，不過Evercore預計隨著該產品於10月中旬正式發布，需求將會逐步回升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">調查還顯示，舊設備老化是推動換機的主要因素，67%的受訪者表示因現有iPhone機齡過長而考慮升級，這一比例較去年的48%大幅上升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">隨著消費者愈來愈傾向選擇更高儲存容量的機型，加上蘋果推出2TB版本的Pro及Duo系列，Evercore預計iPhone平均銷售價格將上漲約28%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此外，Evercore亦留意到消費者對可穿戴設備的興趣有所增強，Apple Watch的購買意向達38%，AirPods則達43%，均較去年有所提升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Evercore提醒，此次調查僅針對美國市場，但整體需求似乎略優於去年同期，並暗示蘋果2027財年的營收有望超越市場普遍預期的約7%增長。該機構維持對蘋果的「跑贏大市」評級，並將目標價上調至380美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E9%A1%AF%E7%A4%BA%E8%98%8B%E6%9E%9Ciphone%E6%8F%9B%E6%A9%9F%E6%BD%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%8F%BE%E5%84%AA%E6%96%BC%E9%A0%90%E6%9C%9F-141359114.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-18 22:21:23",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "Barclays：AI交易趨於成熟，建議加大多元化布局",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Barclays：AI交易趨於成熟，建議加大多元化布局\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/56339762e5bec9485710f531fbc3eda788b6df446592445ab207a1e6e38e0b29/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA7I0CN_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Barclays：AI交易趨於成熟，建議加大多元化布局</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - Barclays週五在致客戶的報告中表示，人工智能相關交易正進入更為成熟的階段，並在對聯準會的政策方向表示歡迎的同時，呼籲投資者加大多元化布局。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">策略師Emmanuel Cau表示，聯準會此次升息25個基點，可以說是對市場而言最不壞的結果，有助於鞏固其抗通脹的公信力與決心。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">他認為，此次會議「最終應被視為一次結算事件，也是一個積極的進展」，並指出在決策公布後，美元匯率趨於穩定，長端殖利率有所回落，股市亦隨之上漲。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-ef83603e-9570-3cc2-9bb7-d6fa60d4d7e0-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">不過，Cau也指出，全球貨幣環境持續收緊，意味著估值承壓，股票回報率可能進一步下滑。他補充說，在能源相關通脹壓力緩解之前，利率與股市難以真正企穩。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在人工智能方面，Cau表示，AI相關交易已從單邊做好的格局演變為波動性更高的局面，隨著投資者對超大規模雲端服務商資本支出可持續性的質疑加深，市場中贏家與輸家之間的分化也日益明顯。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">近期，Anthropic及其他AI開發商呼籲放緩AI發展步伐，進一步加劇了市場的疑慮。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">儘管Barclays仍將AI視為推動增長與盈利的順風因素，但Cau表示，「這一交易顯然正進入更為成熟的階段，波動性與執行風險均在上升。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">他因此主張加大多元化布局，將市場領導力拓展至AI曝險較低的領域，尤其是美國科技板塊以外的市場。他同時指出，美國與其他市場之間的估值差距已開始收窄。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/barclays-ai%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E8%B6%A8%E6%96%BC%E6%88%90%E7%86%9F-%E5%BB%BA%E8%AD%B0%E5%8A%A0%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%83%E5%8C%96%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80-150944752.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-18 23:21:33",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
