        {
            "title": "德意志銀行上調Wickes評級，看好交易改善與項目管線增長",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"德意志銀行上調Wickes評級，看好交易改善與項目管線增長\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ac51ba776461b148e8ddaa003431e679e42e04bb2b4f05fb8f1f3b4941f0183d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPEB6U08A_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">德意志銀行上調Wickes評級，看好交易改善與項目管線增長</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/德意志銀行\" rel=\"\">德意志銀行</a>將Wickes集團（LON:WIX）的評級由「賣出」上調至「持有」，理由是該零售商的交易表現改善、項目管線持續擴大，有效降低了盈利下行風險。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">分析師Benjamin Yokyong-Zoega將目標價由165便士上調至210便士。Wickes股票最新收盤價為192.8便士。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">德意志銀行指出，大額消費品需求疲軟仍是周期性阻力，而通脹升溫亦持續壓制消費者信心。儘管市場環境充滿挑戰，該行預計Wickes仍將持續擴大市場份額。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-3c3c7211-b0e7-3f07-8439-2b4a32e4b2f5-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">德意志銀行表示，Wickes的業績指引意味著下半年稅前利潤將錄得約20%的增長，主要受惠於更強勁的同店銷售表現及進一步的成本節約措施。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">德意志銀行數據顯示，Wickes股價今年迄今累計下跌18%，目前以2026年預期盈利的10.8倍市盈率交易，低於Kingfisher（翠豐集團）的11.4倍。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">本週早些時候，Wickes公佈第三季度交易加速增長，並重申全年盈利指引，消息帶動股價單日上漲逾6%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">零售同店銷售方面，第三季度迄今已轉為中個位數增長，相比之下，上半年則錄得0.3%的跌幅。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至6月27日止26週，Wickes公佈調整後稅前利潤為2,760萬英鎊，高於去年同期的2,730萬英鎊。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">收入增長2.1%至8,653萬英鎊，同店銷售增長0.7%。設計與安裝業務收入由2,134萬英鎊升至2,255萬英鎊，連續第五個季度錄得增長。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BE%B7%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97%E9%8A%80%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%AA%BFwickes%E8%A9%95%E7%B4%9A-%E7%9C%8B%E5%A5%BD%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E8%88%87%E9%A0%85%E7%9B%AE%E7%AE%A1%E7%B7%9A%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%B7-140223565.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-18 22:07:51",
